{'symbol': 'NRG', 'date': '2022-12-06 06:01:00', 'title': 'NRG ENERGY, INC. TO ACQUIRE VIVINT SMART HOME, INC.', 'text': 'HOUSTON & PROVO, UTAH--( BUSINESS WIRE )--NRG ENERGY, INC. (NYSE: NRG) AND VIVINT SMART HOME, INC. (NYSE: VVNT) TODAY ANNOUNCED THEY HAVE ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT UNDER WHICH NRG WILL ACQUIRE VIVINT FOR $12 PER SHARE OR $2.8 BILLION IN AN ALL-CASH TRANSACTION WITH AN IMPLIED MULTIPLE OF 6.3X RUN-RATE ENTERPRISE VALUE TO ADJUSTED EBITDA. THE AGREEMENT HAS BEEN UNANIMOUSLY APPROVED BY THE BOARDS OF DIRECTORS OF BOTH COMPANIES.'}